{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"depraved-frowzy-trout","creation_channel":"cli","description":"# Context\nChange 78257ce2ff (willing-cellular-carp, Gerrit 1652) fixed ONE site in tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py where a two-clone fixture established its shared-base precondition via an unasserted side effect of `_engine_run(repo, \"list\")` — the best-effort `ensure_fresh` read path swallows every failure by design, so under CI load the precondition silently fails and the test dies in setup (flake signature: `AssertionError: clones do not share a base`).\n\nThe closing agent reported the same `_expire_sync_marker` + `_engine_run(...)` sync-by-side-effect pattern at roughly 20 other sites in that file. Each is a latent instance of the identical flake mechanism.\n\n# Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] AC1 — Enumerate every site in tests/integration/test_concurrency_regression.py that relies on `_engine_run(...)`'s incidental sync to establish a fixture precondition (grep for `_expire_sync_marker` and `_engine_run` pairs; verify against `ensure_fresh`'s best-effort contract).\n- [ ] AC2 — Convert each such precondition to the deterministic `_sync_from_origin` helper landed in 78257ce2ff (checked fetch + ff-only merge), or record per-site why the incidental sync is genuinely not load-bearing there.\n- [ ] AC3 — The file's tests pass with `REBAR_SYNC_PULL=off` for every converted site's setup path (the reproduction switch that proved the original flake), and under default env.\n- [ ] AC4 — `make lint` and `make typecheck` pass; no wall-clock assertions introduced.","id":"49be-be9e-9c83-494c","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":[],"ticket_type":"task","title":"Audit remaining sync-by-side-effect fixture sites in test_concurrency_regression.py"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1786529773041626001,"uuid":"635d2799-6fb1-4d5f-8092-89f67c7abfbe"}